This PERMANENTLY DELETES salary registers and all of their detail rows.

Period: {0}/{1}
Run type: {2}
Payroll area: {3}
Scope: {4}

Deleted salary registers cannot be recovered. The operation is aborted if any matched employee already has a later salary register. Continue?

This UNLOCKS salary registers, making already-finalised payroll rows editable again.

Period: {0}/{1}
Run type: {2}
Payroll area: {3}
Scope: {4}

Continue?

This RECALCULATES and OVERWRITES annual-leave forfeit quota balances from {0} onwards.

Scope: {1}

Existing forfeit balances for those employees are replaced. Continue?

This REWRITES transfer flags in the external access-control database so missing punches are re-transferred from {0} until now.

Scope: {1}

Continue?

This RE-PULLS punches from the time-attendance vendor API from {0} until now and writes them into this system.

Scope: {1}

Continue?

This REASSIGNS every open, not-yet-approved workflow approval from "{0}" to "{1}".

Requests included: {2}

The original approver will no longer see those items. Continue?

This RESETS the password of {0} user account(s) and e-mails the new password to each employee in plain text. The old passwords cannot be recovered and the affected users will be locked out until they read the e-mail.
Accounts to reset: {1}
Continue?
